  (text "Notes\nJ13: bank A, inputs, pump: about 10 A\nJ14: bank B and relays: about 8 A\nF12: bank A, inputs, ribbons\nF13: pump\nF14: bank B, relays\nD21: unidirectional TVS: surge clamp, and blows the fuse on reverse polarity\nU17: pump logic 5 V, field side"
    (at 15.24 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid edf7d400-f08b-51e6-8775-eb69d40ca446)
  )
  (text "\nU18: pinout checked (31 Oct)\nU21: about 4 A pump supply with current limit; can PWM a brushed motor to 1 kHz. CHECK rating once the 107Z current is known\nR147: diagnostic, test point only\nD26: motor freewheel\nR149: pump PWM: 24 V push-pull, 20 Hz-25 kHz\nR151: pump DIR: 24 V push-pull, 20 Hz-25 kHz\nD27: clamp to the 5 V rail"
    (at 203.2 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid b5ef58e7-64bb-5236-9de5-74abd8a03659)
  )
  (text "\nR154: 1.5 V threshold\nU24: CHECK pin order for the SOT-23-5 variant\nR156: hysteresis\nJP2: fit for an open-collector tacho\nJ16: Thomas 107Z: signal ground must be field 0 V\nU25: 60 V, 100 mA PhotoMOS\nR163: 5 V -> 3.4 V"
    (at 391.16 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6a110229-de4c-5330-9173-7083e93feddc)
  )

